 "text": "I thought Jiyu had already made the perfect toner pad. Then they dropped these. This is what you grab when your skin needs more than hydration. These are their new cleansing polish pads with two different textures. One side exfoliates, the other smooths. The formula combines multiple exfoliating acids to help with rough texture, clogged pores, and blemishes, plus niacinamide to help balance excess oil and improve the appearance of uneven skin tone. Use them up to three times a week at night when your skin needs that extra reset, especially if your skin's been feeling rough and bumpy instead of baby smooth. These are linked in the orange cart.",
